  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "三維積體封裝技術",
    "sub_ename": "THREE-DIMENSIONAL INTEGRATED CIRCUIT PACKAGING",
    "describe_ch": "半導體業以先進封裝技術將晶片和晶片堆疊，使元件有更快、功耗更低且面積更小。然而，在3DIC封裝中，正面臨許多材料科學的問題。因此，本節課將介紹3DIC封裝技術的原理和透過材料科學來解決其所問題。",
    "describe_eh": "Recently, the big data era is coming, so how to improve the performance of chip becomes important. The semiconductor manufacturing makes chips-chips stacked together via advanced packaging technology to achieve shorter electronic transmission paths, lower power consumption and small area. However, in 3DIC packaging, there are many problems urgently solved by materials science and engineering. Students will learn the principles of 3DIC packaging technology, how to solve its problems through material science.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
